      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The internal boundaries of the lamellar colonies are prone to microcrack initiation during tensile deformation.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A minor boron addition followed by homogenization and near-eutectic annealing will cause boron to segregate preferentially to inter-lamellar boundaries.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9572892::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boron segregation can be made exclusive to the internal lamellar interfaces.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundary-segregated boron will enhance interfacial cohesion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9572892::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundary-segregated boron will pin the internal lamellar boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9572892::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An optimized near-eutectic heat treatment can produce uniform boron segregation without forming secondary borides.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased interfacial cohesion will impede microcrack initiation during tensile loading.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9572892::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing microcrack initiation or propagation can improve the mechanical response of a lamellar Al-Co-Cr-Fe-Ni eutectic high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundary pinning by boron will provide precipitation-like strengthening.",
